  "principles": [
    "Reuse the existing Agri Hub source before creating duplicate implementations.",
    "Keep shared authentication, customer, inventory, billing, order and reporting contracts consistent across apps.",
    "Foundation means shared contracts exist; it does not mean the app is production complete.",
